0..57 Comment "//! This fixture applies a family to an operation result."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..141 Comment "//! The shape is a category with families. A dependent arrow instantiates after"
142..165 Comment "//! the operation runs."
166..169 Comment "//!"
170..246 Comment "//! The arrow yields a type with the same written form. So the family at the"
247..324 Comment "//! result of a call converts with itself. A record field reads its preceding"
325..342 Comment "//! family field."
343..346 Comment "//!"
347..394 Comment "//! - cites: [Dybjer-1996-internal_type_theory]"
395..398 Comment "//!"
399..510 Comment "//! [Dybjer-1996-internal_type_theory]: https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-61780-9_66 \"Dybjer, Internal Type Theory\""
512..582 Comment "/// The `useAtExtension` function applies a family to the result of an"
583..661 Comment "/// operation. The term `q(g)` stands at `tm(extend(g))`, the second domain of"
662..687 Comment "/// `use` at `extend(g)`."
